# Conformance probe pack whose own list has the name of the inner pack's list
# (spec 0.34, Decode step 4 and max_items), most significant bit first.
# Public. No kinds.
#
#   nums        an 8-bit count, then that many items, val in 8 bits each
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-restonly message (its nums are discarded
#               on decode: the outer list is read first)
format     conformance-inner-lists
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.nums count 8
  field  probe.val  8  uint
end
inner   conformance-inner-restonly
